      "side": 1,
      "message": "The race occurs when a configuration object appears after interfaceAddedMatch is spawned but is also returned by get_sub_tree(). In this window, both paths call handleInterfaceAdded() for the same path, and since the first call hasn\u0027t completed initDevice() yet, the second call also passes the devices.contains() check and enters initDevice().",
